<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NO PLAY BEFORE LUNCH IN TVL VS BOLAND GAME.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NO PLAY BEFORE LUNCH IN TVL VS BOLAND GAME.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rain prevented play from starting on time on the opening day of the four-day Supersport Series match between Transvaal and Boland at the Wanderers.</p>
<p>Play was set to start at 1 p.m. if there was no more rain.</p>
<p>Teams and the toss were to be announced later.</p>
